Richard Wurman is a masterful storyteller and reading Information Anxiety2 is the next best thing to hearing him talk. Intimate and wise, it is the perfect antidote to the anxiety produced by the overabundance of information and the dearth of insight. Read it. It is inspiring and compelling.

Arianna Huffington, syndicated columnist;

Author, How To Overthrow the Government

